    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24dcaf3e6d34de326ae75755",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对我来说，蒲公英这样可爱的花儿，\n正是那种精神的象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "918a871ca38d6391fc3d75cfe6a6e5c9547ba0dd4e113d4efa12ce15cfc6d865",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/82/0065/storytimeline_820065002.json",
      "json_path": [
