    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89b42536a4b546fa8302583a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在卖蒲公英茶的店里遇到小草时我都吓了一跳！\n之后还在回学校的路上一起聊了好久呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3e01e53b3d4becf46dc51e3b52462d7f9ac301d0817d7d798c0006d2c15c82c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/82/0065/storytimeline_820065002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1096db1c77487b346db181c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以才结成了『蒲公英同好会』吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd7edf7dc0ec82c6f8df0cf86a1aab0cad2566cd1235a753d9af73226a2f1697",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/82/0065/storytimeline_820065002.json",
      "json_path": [
