    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50552ff7935343e752db4830",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，小鹰你觉得如何？　这下子，\n你晚上就能睡得着，也不会跟踪我了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e82add9e45bdea7132e3806bc84812074cbfcb076b3cdd023584cb5c7e2d75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
