      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯～……\n……小草，真的只是这样吗？\n我觉得，应该有别的理由……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5050ade59295502148d30da78079f84280f8737abea3ed507733313d92e2893",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
