    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9320f5deb3ff974790048910",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来，我看到草上飞训练完正在休息时，\n注视着神鹰的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f06fbb0076e1371b7fc0bc70b44c18db4d01bf50fe0b1ff3d8b808be0129419b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
