      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，我看到草上飞好像在被鹤丸刚志\n推荐吃的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5023ff8b44d8586ea4dbab642fdbc8232e4b290caac7f1c0c15836611730a307",
